ets/posts/erm-02-box-pleating/slit-movement.svg">
        <figcaption>A shape with a slit. The concavity-forming rivers go ba=
ck and forth between the two pictures. Note that the maximum distance is 1.=
 Or is it?</figcaption>
    </figure>
</div>

