<p>Yep, things get weird here, and trying to just finish off incomplete ver=
tices with hinges will get you into a mess. Here=E2=80=99s the proper way t=
o handle this case:</p>

<div class=3D"figrow">
    <figure>
        <img style=3D"max-width: 400px;" src=3D"https://www.hayastl.com/ass=
ets/posts/erm-02-box-pleating/long-gamma-hinges.svg">
        <figcaption>The green dashed lines are the "hinges" that finish off=
 incomplete vertices. They're not true hinges, however.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
        <img style=3D"max-width: 400px;" src=3D"https://www.hayastl.com/ass=
ets/posts/erm-02-box-pleating/long-gamma-final.svg">
